 "entities": {},
 "insight": [
  "The share of EU27 countries in Luxembourg's imports increased from 70.3% in 2005 to 86.6% in 2025.",
  "This represents a rise of 23.2% over the period, with a peak share of 91.5% in 2024.",
  "Conversely, the share of non-EU27 countries in imports decreased from 29.7% in 2005 to 13.4% in 2025, a drop of 54.8%, with their highest share being 35.1% in 2006.",
  "The data show a clear trend of increasing reliance on EU27 partners for imports over these years.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
